49
00:09:46.100 --> 00:10:02.960
David: And then you get some sort of data struct out of it. So, it's a classic, you need to serialization for that. Serialization is obviously rather difficult, on ZKVMs, so we thought we would rely on the FAB format, because it's internal to, compact, and it seems quite efficient.

50
00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:19.730
